{"c":[{"id":"60828e069b1c490e","sum":"B30/R2: goal drafts check whole typed facts (goals/drafts.ts; every digit lands in a fact; add whole-expression rules, never token allowlists). Typing replays send a typed value in the same snapshot as its text, or no breakpoint opens.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T120623Z-4f068d6de508aa09","text":"B30: drafted goal text is checked in goals/drafts.ts as whole typed facts; every digit must land in a fact, and a from value ref stands for its source window or memory. Two reviews found recombination holes: add whole-expression rules, never token allowlists.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T155131Z-2d735fed11dec073","text":"R2: scripts that replay typing must send a typed value (snapshot values) in the same snapshot as its text: a value that arrives after the sentence boundary opens no breakpoint, so the event card is never listed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9774fe46b42d75d6","sum":"R2: a recorded snapshot needs the reader's focusedKey or Router 1 abstains ('not in a text field'); Router 1 is skipped only for offers built on a held offer's own record (routing/consent.ts), and messages writing such records count only from a host session.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T155131Z-b3055d198779a6ea","text":"R2: a recorded snapshot without the reader's focusedKey makes Router 1 read 'the cursor is not in a text field' and abstain; A5's offers-loop.ndjson lacked it until 831ab47, which is why H6 saw the loop abstain.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T155145Z-05c6fed3ed39acff","text":"R2: Router 1 is skipped only for offers Helper.consentedCandidates builds on a held offer's own record (routing/consent.ts). Messages that write such records (skillAnswer, resume, skills/ save, watch role) count only from a host session.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
